==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Shin Japan Heroes Universe Collaboration Event|Shin Japan Heroes Universe]] Units

==Battleground==
*1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Cat Godzilla (Rare Cat)|Cat Godzilla]] should be able to solo this level. The Face is not enough of a threat on his own, and the Mooths appear sparsely enough to not overwhelm a decently-leveled Cat Godzilla. Notably, [[Cat Combo]]s can still be used here if needed.

